  "marker32PublicDraftReadback": {
    "body": "Implements the handwritten ScalarConstruct relation and transition consumer for Leaf, Cons and Branch. Disabled transitions constrain the identity post-state. The suite contains 32 tests: 15 genuine-owner/positive cases and 17 raw statement cases across LocalPublic and LedgerCall, including Marker admission, literal-validation boundaries, staging and rejection controls.\n\nFresh independent Muse source reviews approved the emitter/consumer and the six added test cases within their stated scope. All 32 tests remain uncompiled and unrun; Cargo/SDK compilation and execution are still required. The emitter, consumer and parent remain unchanged by the latest test addition, and all 26 earlier test bodies are byte-identical.\n\nThe SI17 snapshot projection is a host diagnostic. Raw held-Marker specimens intentionally violate SI17 and SI08/SI21 entry identity. Full in-circuit SI17, StepInv/program binding, full39, recursion, stagenet and benchmark obligations remain open. No native proof or degree result is claimed. Local CI only.\n",
